{"id":"8841d990db08f7a2","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-conjunction-axiom.md","title":"合取公理 Ax-land","display":"df-conjunction-axiom — 合取公理 Ax-land","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-conjunction-axiom","aliases":["91-df-conjunction-axiom","91-df-conjunction-truth-axiom"],"display":"df-conjunction-axiom — 合取公理 Ax-land","depends_on":["[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","[[91-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-conjunction-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-conjunction-axiom</span><span>91-df-conjunction-truth-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-conjunction-axiom — 合取公理 Ax-land"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"97fe560478d37064\" href=\"?note=97fe560478d37064\" title=\"91-df-language-with-truth\">91-df-language-with-truth</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-conjunction-axiom-—-合取公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}$\">df-conjunction-axiom — 合取公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (扩展语言句子集)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (允许实例化该模式的句子域)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjunction\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D\n\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjunction\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D\n\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}\\)</span> : 合取公理（conjunction axiom）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\land\">\\(\\land\\)</span> : 逻辑合取</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合取公理的含义：\n合取公理规定：对给定实例域 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span>，合取句子\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\land \\psi\">\\(\\varphi \\land \\psi\\)</span> 是真的，当且仅当两个合取支都是真的。这是组合公理\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}\\)</span> 中关于合取联结词的部分。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>TB 与 UTB 直接给出类型化双条件式，不把该型自由模式列为公理；\nCT 的组合子句只针对基础语言公式编码，而 KF、FS 的相应子句允许\n含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> 的句子。相同的表面公式必须结合其量化域判断。</p>\n<p>合取公理与其他组合公理的关系：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>完整组合公理化还需要原子式、否定和量词子句。</li>\n<li>各子句的独立性是模型论结论，不能仅从“处理不同连接词”直接推出。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>合取公理的析取对偶：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner x \\lor y \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(x) \\lor T(y) \\quad \\mathrm{(析取公理)}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\ulcorner x \\lor y \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(x) \\lor T(y) \\quad \\mathrm{(析取公理)}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>只有在还拥有适用范围相同的经典否定子句时，才能借 De Morgan 律导出\n相应析取子句；KF 的内部否定不能被无条件替换为外部经典否定。</p>\n<p>定义的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>理解组合真理的基本构成</li>\n<li>分析各公理的独立贡献</li>\n<li>理解组合公理集的结构</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-conjunction-axiom-—-合取公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}$","text":"df-conjunction-axiom — 合取公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-language-with-truth","status":"resolved","id":"97fe560478d37064","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-language-with-truth]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-numeral]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T$ (真理谓词, see [[91-df-truth-predicate]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}conjunction\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}(\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\land\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\bigl(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\bigr)\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathcal D\n\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\land}","display":false},{"tex":"\\land","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi \\land \\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\mathrm{Comp}}","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\land \\psi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner) \\land T(\\ulcorner \\psi \\urcorner)","display":true},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T(\\ulcorner x \\lor y \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow T(x) \\lor T(y) \\quad \\mathrm{(析取公理)}","display":true}],"bytes":2349,"backlinks":[{"id":"0e138b4c93cfb69a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4278731e7fc892de","anchor":"ref-29","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-conjunction-axiom]]"},{"id":"e93fc3e2f8fd50d4","anchor":"ref-22","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[91-df-CT.md]]\n[[91-df-FS-n.md]]\n[[91-df-FS.md]]\n[[91-df-KF-plus.md]]\n[[91